# .env.example — placeholders only. Copy to `.env` (already gitignored) and fill in real values
# ONLY if you need to run `supabase functions serve` locally. NEVER put real values in this file.
#
# These are Edge Function secrets — they belong in Supabase (see SECRETS_SETUP.md), not in the
# iOS app. The Swift app only ever uses SUPABASE_PROJECT_REF / SUPABASE_ANON_KEY from
# Secrets.xcconfig, which is a separate, iOS-only, gitignored file.

# Google Books API key — required by supabase/functions/search-google-books.
# Get one at https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials after enabling the "Books API".
# Free, but quota-limited without billing enabled. See BOOK_API_PROVIDERS.md.
GOOGLE_BOOKS_API_KEY=

# Europeana API key (wskey) — required by supabase/functions/search-europeana.
# Get one at https://www.europeana.eu/en (sign in → account → request an API key). Free.
EUROPEANA_API_KEY=

# HathiTrust — NOT currently required. The Bibliographic API used by HathiTrustProvider.swift
# is free and keyless. Only add this if you later integrate HathiTrust's Data API (full text),
# which requires an institutional agreement — see BOOK_API_PROVIDERS.md.
HATHITRUST_API_KEY=
